   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PEB301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Practice of Embedded System — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13935 · Decision 1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/12/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PEB301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Practice of Embedded System — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13935 · QĐ 1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 12/12/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">PEB301</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">Practice of Embedded System _Thực hành hệ thống nhúng</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">45h (60 sessions) contact hours + 105h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">EBS211, NWC204</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Inquiry-Based Learning,In-class lecture, Active Learning</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13935</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">PEB301</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Practice of Embedded System _Thực hành hệ thống nhúng</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">45h (60 sessions) contact hours + 105h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">EBS211, NWC204</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Inquiry-Based Learning,In-class lecture, Active Learning</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13935</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>- This practical module emphasizes hands-on experience with embedded systems by assembling, wiring, and interfacing hardware components with microcontroller boards. Students will practice programming and operating electrical, electronic, and microcontroller devices, reinforcing the theoretical knowledge acquired from embedded system modules. Through guided lab sessions, learners will configure and test peripherals such as GPIO, ADC, timers, communication interfaces (SPI, I2C, UART), and integrate them into functional applications.<br><br>- The course highlights real-world practices, including debugging, measurement, documentation of experiments, and the use of development tools such as S32 Design Studio and SDK. By the end of the module, students will gain practical skills in setting up embedded systems, verifying their operation, and applying learned theories to build and demonstrate complete embedded applications.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>- This practical module emphasizes hands-on experience with embedded systems by assembling, wiring, and interfacing hardware components with microcontroller boards. Students will practice programming and operating electrical, electronic, and microcontroller devices, reinforcing the theoretical knowledge acquired from embedded system modules. Through guided lab sessions, learners will configure and test peripherals such as GPIO, ADC, timers, communication interfaces (SPI, I2C, UART), and integrate them into functional applications.<br><br>- The course highlights real-world practices, including debugging, measurement, documentation of experiments, and the use of development tools such as S32 Design Studio and SDK. By the end of the module, students will gain practical skills in setting up embedded systems, verifying their operation, and applying learned theories to build and demonstrate complete embedded applications.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13935\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13935</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13935\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13935</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
